<title>CHINA: Hopewell says not in talks with Everbright.</title>
<headline>Hopewell says not in talks with Everbright.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hopewell Holdings Ltd said in a statement on Friday that it was not in negotiations with the China Everbright group regarding a possible acquisition of a Hopewell stake by Everbright.</p>
<p>The statement was made at the request of the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong following a rise of HK$0.60 in Hopewell shares to HK$5.30 on Thursday amid speculation that China Everbright Holdings Co Ltd could take a stake in the company.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
